  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 101.20 “Great pond” means a water body of 10 acres or more in its natural condition.\n\nSource. #1716, eff 2-20-81; ss by #2207, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2900, eff 11-7-84; amd by #4278, eff 6-30-87; ss by #4534, eff 11-30-88; ss by #5080, eff 2-22-91; ss by #6462-A, eff 2-21-97; ss by #8288, INTERIM, eff 2-21-05, EXPIRES: 8-20-05; ss by #8412, eff 8-20-05; ss by #10508, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13979, eff 5-24-24 (formerly Env-Wr 101.19) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Wr 100)",
